# Constraint files (.xdc) for qick_zcu216
# Paths relative to the repository root
#
# Example:
# firmware/constraints/qick_zcu216.xdc
# firmware/constraints/timing.xdc
Top/216/tpv2_std_rfbv2/ios.xdc
# timing.xdc: clock groups of clocks created inside the block design's IPs (RFDC, PS, clk_wiz).
# They do not exist yet in the top-level synthesis (the IPs are synthesized out of context), so the
# file is nosynth: there it only produced 'No valid object(s)' critical warnings; it applies in
# implementation, where it matters.
Top/216/tpv2_std_rfbv2/timing.xdc nosynth
Top/216/tpv2_std_rfbv2/timing_paths.xdc
